  "summary": "I am a recent college graduate with strong technical skills and a fierce curiosity about computer systems.  My area of interest is in working with software that advances scientific knowledge.  After graduating from Rutgers University in 2019 I worked at Sharp Electronics where I accomplished the following tasks: developed web software to increase employee productivity, resolved conflicts between the corporate world and individual branches, increased customer satisfaction by resolving technical issues, and provided instruction on the proper use of Sharp software.  I also have taken time to work on software for a local volunteer animal shelter that will help them track volunteer work schedules and animal care.  I am strongly interested in advancing my computer science skills by challenging myself with new opportunities.  Especially attracted to opportunities in the scientific world.",
